lava. Once you do that he can't get to you, but you can attack him with
range weapons. Or sleep him and kick his butt.

So my Mater Kaen kit consist of:

1. A means of getting out over the lava. This including either fireproof
   WW boots or levitiation.

2. A way of zapping Kaen. Usually sleep.

