4. Instant controlled teleport. =oTC + either / or ? of teleport. Not a
   =oTele because you don't get and instant effect. Remember that you
   cannot teleport over the lava. So plan to teleport to a space next to
   the lava lake of choice and then walk or float over.

Once you know how to handle him, he falls pretty regularly.

